Package: Vecchia
Type: Package
Title: Vecchia
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2025-04-13
Author: Qilong Pan[aut, cph], Sohayla Khaled [aut, cph], Mahmoud ElKarargy [aut, cph], Sameh Abdulah [cre, cph], KAUST King Abdullah University of Science and Technology [fnd, cph]
Maintainer: Sameh Abdulah <sameh.abdulah@kaust.edu.sa>
Description: Vecchia is a package for computing the Vecchia approximation of a Gaussian process. It is designed to be fast and memory efficient, and to work with both dense and sparse matrices.
